":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-07-07T09:05:52Z","updated_at":"2025-08-03T19:23:20Z","closed_at":"2025-08-03T16:27:29Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108373","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108373","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108373.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108373.patch","merged_at":"2025-08-03T16:27:29Z"},"body":"In the SDL joystick input PR I decided to not compile it with libudev because it was a bit too late to make new changes.\r\nYesterday I found out that SDL actually uses dynamic loading of libudev and uses the <libudev.h> only for structs, typedefs, etc. in the thirdparty/sdl/core/linux/SDL_udev.c file, so I decided to fix the compilation of libudev to use the header file that was already bundled with Godot's source code (thirdparty/linuxbsd_headers/udev/libudev.h) and in another file (thirdparty/sdl/hidapi/linux/hid.c) where SDL actually does use functions from said header, I redirect the calls to the struct where they're loaded dynamically (the one in SDL_udev.c). And I removed the usage of SOWRAP_ENABLED in the detect.py file where UDEV_ENABLED is defined, because SDL loads the library dynamically anyway and we probably can't/shouldn't change the way it works.\r\nI tested the PR with WSL and it didn't seem to crash or break the controller support (my Dualshock 4 and a cheap Sega Mega Drive-like controller work fine just like before), so I assume it works 😅 (EDIT: need testing again)\r\n\r\nEDIT: also made dbus load \"statically\" too (i.e. pull its functions from Godot binaries just like udev without SDL_UDEV_DYNAMIC)\r\n\r\nTODO:\r\n- [x] SDL can load the library \"statically\" if null is passed to dlsym() (i.e. search for the symbols inside of Godot binaries instead of a separate library file, I think?), so we can check for SOWRAP_ENABLED here\r\n- [x] Do the same for dbus","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108373/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108373/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}